{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "principle": "ONE RESPONSIBILITY → ONE OWNER → ONE AUTHORITATIVE SOURCE → ONE IMPLEMENTATION PATH",
  "layers": {
    "presentation": [
      "src/views/",
      "src/components/",
      "src/stores/",
      "src/layouts/",
      "src/presentation/"
    ],
    "application": [
      "src/application/"
    ],
    "domain": [
      "src/domain/"
    ],
    "repositories": [
      "src/repositories/"
    ],
    "infrastructure": [
      "src/infrastructure/"
    ],
    "localDatabase": [
      "src/utils/indexedDB.js"
    ],
    "futureIntegrations": []
  },
  "canonicalRuntimeFlow": [
    "presentation",
    "application",
    "domain",
    "repositories",
    "localDatabase"
  ],
  "allowedImports": {
    "presentation": [
      "application"
    ],
    "application": [
      "domain",
      "repositories"
    ],
    "domain": [],
    "repositories": [
      "localDatabase",
      "domain"
    ],
    "infrastructure": [
      "repositories",
      "localDatabase",
      "futureIntegrations",
      "application",
      "domain"
    ],
    "localDatabase": [],
    "futureIntegrations": []
  },
  "forbiddenDependencies": [
    [
      "domain",
      "presentation"
    ],
    [
      "domain",
      "application"
    ],
    [
      "domain",
      "repositories"
    ],
    [
      "domain",
      "infrastructure"
    ],
    [
      "domain",
      "localDatabase"
    ],
    [
      "application",
      "presentation"
    ],
    [
      "application",
      "localDatabase"
    ],
    [
      "presentation",
      "repositories"
    ],
    [
      "presentation",
      "localDatabase"
    ],
    [
      "presentation",
      "infrastructure"
    ]
  ],
  "directPersistenceForbiddenIn": [
    "src/views/",
    "src/components/",
    "src/stores/",
    "src/layouts/",
    "src/presentation/",
    "src/application/",
    "src/domain/"
  ],
  "directBusinessCalculationForbiddenIn": [
    "src/views/",
    "src/components/",
    "src/stores/",
    "src/layouts/",
    "src/presentation/"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "UI/UX and shell remain decoupled from infrastructure providers.",
    "External providers must be reached through replaceable infrastructure adapters.",
    "Application may depend on application-owned runtime port contracts; only the infrastructure composition root may bind those ports to platform adapters.",
    "src/main.js is the composition root and installs infrastructure adapters before mounting the Vue application.",
    "Repositories and infrastructure adapters may depend inward on domain primitives; infrastructure may additionally bind application-owned ports. Neither may import presentation."
  ]
}
